From: OpenWrt msm8916 port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8916-generic-mifib-v12: enable call audio

Include the shared voice dtsi so the mifib-v12 gets the same q6voice sound
card as the UFI sticks: QDSP6 voice over APR, the internal BT SCO link of
WCNSS, and the in-call record/playback ports.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-generic-mifib-v12.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-generic-mifib-v12.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-generic-mifib-v12.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8916-generic-mifib-v12.dts
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 /dts-v1/;
 
 #include "msm8916-ufi.dtsi"
+#include "msm8916-ufi-voice.dtsi"
 
 #include <dt-bindings/iio/qcom,spmi-vadc.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/leds/common.h>
